      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;tc mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/Team logo.png&#34; style=&#34;max-width:200px;&#34; alt=&#34;Youth STEAM Initiative Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;br&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/Logo_Transparent.png&#34; style=&#34;max-width:200px;&#34; alt=&#34;Illuminate Heritage: Lightscapes of Lexington Event Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;creative-and-animation-leadership&#34;&gt;Creative and Animation Leadership&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/anameli.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Ana Meli Olivo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt3 mb1&#34;&gt;Ana Meli Olivo&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;f5 lh-copy mid-gray&#34;&gt;Creative Director&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/ianwang2.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Ian Wang&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt3 mb1&#34;&gt;Ian Wang&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;f5 lh-copy mid-gray&#34;&gt;Film Director&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;youth-leadership-team&#34;&gt;Youth Leadership Team&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-third-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/StephenYang2.png&#34; style=&#34;width:120px; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Stephen Yang&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt3 mb1&#34;&gt;Stephen Yang&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;f5 mid-gray&#34;&gt;Event Chair&lt;/p&gt;</description>
