    <item>
      <title>Call for Photos</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/photos/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/photos/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;community-photo-submission-update&#34;&gt;Community Photo Submission Update&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The community photo submission deadline officially closed on May 16, and we are deeply grateful to have received around 100 photo stories from local residents, organizations, youth groups, artists, schools, volunteers, and community leaders.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Behind these 100+ photos are hundreds of ordinary people who quietly chose to step forward for the community: students mentoring younger children, parents running zero-waste stations, scouts restoring gardens and historic spaces, artists creating public art, musicians performing for seniors, volunteers organizing food drives, cultural groups building bridges across traditions, and neighbors helping neighbors in ways both large and small.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
