    <item>
      <title>Sponsors</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/sponsors/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/sponsors/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We invite businesses, families, and community partners to support this youth-led public celebration honoring the people and groups whose everyday contributions strengthen Lexington through art, technology, storytelling, and civic pride.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;our-sponsors&#34;&gt;Our Sponsors&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-gold-sponsors&#34;&gt;🥇 Gold Sponsors&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/caellia.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Caellia Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt2 mb1&#34;&gt;Caellia&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://caellia.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;f5 link dim dark-gray&#34;&gt;Learn more →&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-silver-sponsors&#34;&gt;🥈 Silver Sponsors&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/CultureBridge.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:30%;&#34; alt=&#34;Cultural Bridge Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt2 mb1&#34;&gt;Cultural Bridge Youth Program&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://caal-ma.org/youthcouncil/culture-bridge/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;f5 link dim dark-gray&#34;&gt;Learn more →&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/BejingDining.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Beijing Chinese Dining Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt2 mb1&#34;&gt;Beijing Chinese Dining&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.beijingchinesedining.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;f5 link dim dark-gray&#34;&gt;Learn more →&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-bronze-sponsors&#34;&gt;🥉 Bronze Sponsors&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/robot.png&#34; style=&#34;width:160px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:50%;&#34; alt=&#34;Robotfun Academy Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt2 mb1&#34;&gt;Robotfun Academy&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.robotfunacademy.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;f5 link dim dark-gray&#34;&gt;Learn more →&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3 tc&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/shoplexington.jpg&#34; style=&#34;width:240px; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:20%;&#34; alt=&#34;Shop Lexington Logo&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt2 mb1&#34;&gt;Shop Lexington&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://shoplexingtonfirst.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;f5 link dim dark-gray&#34;&gt;Learn more →&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;sponsorship-levels&#34;&gt;Sponsorship Levels&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap justify-center mt3 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;ba b--light-silver pa3 br2 h-100&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;h3 class=&#34;f3 fw7 mt0&#34; style=&#34;color:#CFB53B;&#34;&gt;🥇 Gold: $1,000+&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;ul class=&#34;f5 lh-copy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Major logo placement on website, flyers, and event signage&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Exclusive 30-second display during the projection mapping show&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Featured website placement with QR code and shout-outs during opening remarks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;ba b--light-silver pa3 br2 h-100&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;h3 class=&#34;f3 fw7 mt0&#34; style=&#34;color:#A8A9AD;&#34;&gt;🥈 Silver: $500-999&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;ul class=&#34;f5 lh-copy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Logo included on the event website and physical signage&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Formal recognition during the opening remarks&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Name and link listed on the official sponsor page&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-50-l w-100 pa3&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;ba b--light-silver pa3 br2 h-100&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;h3 class=&#34;f3 fw7 mt0&#34; style=&#34;color:#b5a642;&#34;&gt;🥉 Bronze: $100-499&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;ul class=&#34;f5 lh-copy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Name listed in the supporter appreciation section and sponsor page&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;Inclusion in the collective public thank-you recognition&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-sponsor&#34;&gt;Why Sponsor?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Support youth education and innovation in STEAM&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Increase visibility within the Lexington community&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Align your brand with creativity, leadership, and service&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Celebrate the citizens who make Lexington strong&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;grants--funding&#34;&gt;Grants &amp;amp; Funding&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;tc mt4 mb4&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/CEL_10Years_Final.png&#34; style=&#34;max-width:200px;&#34; alt=&#34;Community Endowment of Lexington&#34; /&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;h3 class=&#34;f4 fw6 mt3&#34;&gt;Community Endowment of Lexington&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;f5 lh-copy measure center mid-gray&#34;&gt;&#34;The Community Endowment of Lexington enhances the quality of life for Lexington citizens. CEL awards grants to nonprofits and town agencies working in the areas of health and human services, arts and culture, the environment, and community building.&#34;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
